Recommends: ydotool, wtype, wl-clipboard
Description: Linux voice-to-text dictation tool using Whisper
 voice2text is a push-to-talk voice dictation tool for Linux. Hold a
 configurable hotkey (default: F23), speak into your microphone, and
 your speech is transcribed locally using OpenAI's Whisper model and
 typed into the active window.
 .
 Features:
  - Offline speech-to-text via whisper.cpp
  - Automatic text injection via uinput, ydotool, wtype, or clipboard
  - Configurable trigger key and Whisper model
